{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-inference-product","title":"因果推断与产品决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/product-analytics-growth/analysis/causal-inference-product","wordCount":1593,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"因果推断与产品决策\">因果推断与产品决策</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>产品团队面临的最核心问题往往是因果性的：如果我们修改了这个功能，用户留存会提升吗？如果我们调整了定价，付费转化率会变化吗？这类问题的回答需要因果推断，而不仅仅是相关性分析。</p>\n<p>随机对照实验（A/B 测试）是回答因果问题的黄金标准。但在现实中，很多情况下 A/B 测试要么无法执行（功能已经全量上线、法规限制、道德约束），要么成本极高（需要大量用户才能达到统计功效），要么自然发生（政策变化、外部事件）。</p>\n<p>准实验方法（Quasi-Experimental Methods）填补了这个空白。它们利用真实世界中的&quot;自然随机性&quot;来逼近因果推断，虽然没有 A/B 测试严格，但在许多场景下已经足以支撑高质量的产品决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[我们能做 A/B 测试吗？] --&gt;|是| RCT[随机对照实验&lt;br/&gt;最强因果证据]&#10;    Q --&gt;|否| TYPE{为什么不能？}&#10;    TYPE --&gt;|政策已全量/历史数据| DID[DID / 合成控制]&#10;    TYPE --&gt;|存在自然阈值/规则| RDD[断点回归 RDD]&#10;    TYPE --&gt;|有工具变量| IV[工具变量法]&#10;    TYPE --&gt;|配对样本可行| PSM[倾向得分匹配]\">graph TD\n    Q[我们能做 A/B 测试吗？] --&gt;|是| RCT[随机对照实验&lt;br/&gt;最强因果证据]\n    Q --&gt;|否| TYPE{为什么不能？}\n    TYPE --&gt;|政策已全量/历史数据| DID[DID / 合成控制]\n    TYPE --&gt;|存在自然阈值/规则| RDD[断点回归 RDD]\n    TYPE --&gt;|有工具变量| IV[工具变量法]\n    TYPE --&gt;|配对样本可行| PSM[倾向得分匹配]</pre><h2 id=\"did-差分中的差分\">DID：差分中的差分</h2><p>DID（Difference-in-Differences）是最常用的准实验方法。它的核心思想是：通过比较&quot;处理组&quot;和&quot;对照组&quot;在政策实施前后的变化差异，消除共同趋势（common trend）的影响，从而识别因果效应。</p>\n<p><strong>经典场景</strong>：某产品在某个城市/渠道率先上线了新功能，其他城市/渠道保持不变。如何评估新功能的效果？</p>\n<p><strong>DID 的识别假设——平行趋势假设（Parallel Trends）</strong>：如果新功能没有上线，处理组和对照组的指标变化趋势应该是平行的。这个假设无法被直接证伪（因为我们无法观察反事实），但可以通过检验功能上线之前两组的趋势是否平行来提供间接证据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pandas as pd&#10;import numpy as np&#10;from statsmodels.formula.api import ols&#10;&#10;# 构造 DID 数据&#10;# treatment: 是否属于处理组（1=处理组，0=对照组）&#10;# post: 是否在政策实施后（1=实施后，0=实施前）&#10;# outcome: 被观测指标（如日均订单数）&#10;&#10;df = pd.DataFrame({&#10;    &#39;group&#39;: [&#39;treatment&#39;] * 200 + [&#39;control&#39;] * 200,&#10;    &#39;period&#39;: [&#39;pre&#39;] * 100 + [&#39;post&#39;] * 100 + [&#39;pre&#39;] * 100 + [&#39;post&#39;] * 100,&#10;    &#39;outcome&#39;: np.concatenate([&#10;        np.random.normal(50, 5, 100),    # 处理组实施前&#10;        np.random.normal(65, 5, 100),    # 处理组实施后（有真实提升+10）&#10;        np.random.normal(48, 5, 100),    # 对照组实施前&#10;        np.random.normal(53, 5, 100),    # 对照组实施后（自然趋势+5）&#10;    ])&#10;})&#10;&#10;df[&#39;treatment&#39;] = (df[&#39;group&#39;] == &#39;treatment&#39;).astype(int)&#10;df[&#39;post&#39;] = (df[&#39;period&#39;] == &#39;post&#39;).astype(int)&#10;df[&#39;treat_post&#39;] = df[&#39;treatment&#39;] * df[&#39;post&#39;]  # 交互项&#10;&#10;# DID 回归&#10;model = ols(&#39;outcome ~ treatment + post + treat_post&#39;, data=df).fit()&#10;print(model.summary())&#10;&#10;# treat_post 的系数就是 DID 估计量&#10;# 应该约等于 (65-50) - (53-48) = 15 - 5 = 10（真实因果效应）&#10;did_estimate = model.params[&#39;treat_post&#39;]&#10;print(f&quot;\\nDID 估计量（因果效应）: {did_estimate:.2f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statsmodels.formula.api </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ols</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构造 DID 数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># treatment: 是否属于处理组（1=处理组，0=对照组）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># post: 是否在政策实施后（1=实施后，0=实施前）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># outcome: 被观测指标（如日均订单数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.DataFrame({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'group'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'treatment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'control'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'period'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pre'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pre'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'outcome'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: np.concatenate([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        np.random.normal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 处理组实施前</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        np.random.normal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">65</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 处理组实施后（有真实提升+10）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        np.random.normal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对照组实施前</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        np.random.normal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">53</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对照组实施后（自然趋势+5）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'treatment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'group'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'treatment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).astype(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'period'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).astype(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'treat_post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'treatment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 交互项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># DID 回归</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ols(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'outcome ~ treatment + post + treat_post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df).fit()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model.summary())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># treat_post 的系数就是 DID 估计量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 应该约等于 (65-50) - (53-48) = 15 - 5 = 10（真实因果效应）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">did_estimate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.params[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'treat_post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DID 估计量（因果效应）: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">did_estimate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>DID 的局限性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>平行趋势假设在处理组和对照组差异较大时可能不成立</li>\n<li>无法控制在政策实施时同时发生的其他变化（Confounders）</li>\n<li>标准误需要在群体层面聚类（Cluster-Robust SE），避免低估置信区间</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>产品中的 DID 应用案例</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>处理组</th>\n<th>对照组</th>\n<th>结果指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>App Store 评分变化影响</td>\n<td>评分下降的应用</td>\n<td>评分未变的同类应用</td>\n<td>下载量变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞品降价</td>\n<td>受竞品影响渠道的用户</td>\n<td>未受影响渠道的用户</td>\n<td>付费转化率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节假日促销效果</td>\n<td>参与促销用户</td>\n<td>未参与用户</td>\n<td>复购率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"synthetic-control-合成控制法\">Synthetic Control（合成控制法）</h2><p>合成控制法（Synthetic Control Method）由 Abadie 等人于 2003 年提出，特别适合只有<strong>一个处理单元</strong>（例如只有一个国家/城市/产品线进行了政策变化）的场景。</p>\n<p>其核心思想是：用多个对照单元的加权组合，构造出一个&quot;合成&quot;的对照组，使得这个合成组在政策实施前的指标轨迹与处理组尽可能吻合。然后将政策实施后的实际轨迹与合成对照组的预测轨迹进行比较，差值即为因果效应。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.linear_model import Ridge&#10;import matplotlib.pyplot as plt&#10;&#10;# 假设数据：一个城市上线了新功能，其他5个城市未上线&#10;# 每个城市有24个月的数据，第12个月是功能上线时间点&#10;&#10;np.random.seed(42)&#10;n_months = 24&#10;intervention_month = 12&#10;&#10;# 对照组：5个城市的月度留存率（%）&#10;control_cities = {&#10;    &#39;City_B&#39;: np.array([40+i*0.3+np.random.normal(0,1) for i in range(n_months)]),&#10;    &#39;City_C&#39;: np.array([42+i*0.2+np.random.normal(0,1.5) for i in range(n_months)]),&#10;    &#39;City_D&#39;: np.array([38+i*0.4+np.random.normal(0,0.8) for i in range(n_months)]),&#10;    &#39;City_E&#39;: np.array([45+i*0.1+np.random.normal(0,1.2) for i in range(n_months)]),&#10;    &#39;City_F&#39;: np.array([41+i*0.35+np.random.normal(0,1.1) for i in range(n_months)]),&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 处理城市：前12个月与对照组相似，后12个月有约+5%的政策效果&#10;treatment_pre = np.array([41+i*0.25+np.random.normal(0,1) for i in range(intervention_month)])&#10;treatment_post = np.array([44+i*0.25+5+np.random.normal(0,1)&#10;                           for i in range(intervention_month, n_months)])&#10;treatment_city = np.concatenate([treatment_pre, treatment_post])&#10;&#10;# 构造合成控制：用处理前数据拟合权重&#10;X = np.column_stack([v[:intervention_month] for v in control_cities.values()])&#10;y = treatment_pre&#10;&#10;# 非负约束 + L2 正则（实际应用中应使用更严格的优化）&#10;ridge = Ridge(alpha=0.1, positive=True)&#10;ridge.fit(X, y)&#10;weights = ridge.coef_ / ridge.coef_.sum()  # 归一化权重&#10;&#10;# 生成合成对照组的完整预测&#10;X_full = np.column_stack([v for v in control_cities.values()])&#10;synthetic_control = X_full @ weights&#10;&#10;# 计算处理效果&#10;att = treatment_city[intervention_month:] - synthetic_control[intervention_month:]&#10;print(f&quot;平均处理效果 (ATT): {att.mean():.2f}%&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.linear_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Ridge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matplotlib.pyplot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 假设数据：一个城市上线了新功能，其他5个城市未上线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每个城市有24个月的数据，第12个月是功能上线时间点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.random.seed(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_months </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 24</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intervention_month </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对照组：5个城市的月度留存率（%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">control_cities </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'City_B'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: np.array([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.random.normal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</sp